country will be given a once in a lifetime experience of travelling to Antarctica to learn more about sustainability, the diverse ecosystem and conservation.<br>\n<br>\n <br>\n<br>\nThis epic adventure was founded by pioneering explorer Riaan Manser. His passion for the environment, outdoors and conservation is propelling him to share this experience with the youth and to educate them on the importance of preserving this beautiful planet.<br>\n<br>\n <br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Proposal Date:</span> Thursday, 06 October 2022<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Chwayitisa Futshane<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 13 October 2022<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Commission</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Commission Number:</span> 6249<br><span class=\"headin\">Duration:</span> 2<br><span class=\"headin\">Delivery Date:</span> Sunday, 09 October 2022<br><span class=\"headin\">Legal Viewing:</span> No<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted By:</span> Chwayitisa Futshane<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted Date:</span> 07 October 2022<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Broadcast / Deli